    "route_summary": "Complete the Klondike Derby through final scoring, the requested key pause and concluding reflection. Prefer the author's everyone-happy full route. The one-person and two-person upset victories are intentional alternate complete outcomes, not reasons to restart for a perfect result. Individual events, raw score or an END marker alone are insufficient. Disqualification, impossible over-four-win cheat detection and internal-error termination are failures, not successful collection.",
